{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/kentucky-s-braden-peiser-goes-perfect-and-the-ncaa-rifle-streak-rolls-on/","version_id":"d51b45ea4b6951612bcbb16487a1c7b1dfe31e7f41ce91c4758844b974ee8bc2","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this NCAA air rifle and smallbore results report provides no evidence about eligible gear under Mammoth conditions; Peiser's scores and Walther rifle identification do not establish transferable gear suitability. Under Commercial incentives, the source is an NRA publication identified as commercial, with no specific product sponsorship disclosed in the report.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/hillsdale-college-freshman-orientation-moves-to-the-range/","version_id":"223ac76bdca44c72d18a8a57a9914e9aa3827fca82a8d6badb986e7cd32f96e6","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this account of freshman orientation, supervised introductory shooting and college range programs is outside the Mammoth gear brief and supplies no relevant equipment evaluation. Under Commercial incentives, the NRA publication describes classes using the NRA safety course and promotes range participation, but discloses no gear sponsorship.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/how-one-postal-match-bridged-u-s-and-australian-smallbore-competition/","version_id":"dfe20c8f0859a52b3701924f5d8408272e5038121f3b5221569e65735885376b","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, the postal-match results, international exchange plans and entry instructions offer no evidence about non-firearm gear for Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives, this NRA publication covers and encourages participation in NRA-affiliated competition; no product sponsorship is disclosed.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/rusty-newton-goes-5-for-5-at-3-119-yards-to-win-king-of-2-miles/","version_id":"4799926ea28986e7e4381d742db4cfb9566a7f8cc054c0db8a54d0c21e273638","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility and Making the decision, this ELR match report lists eligible optics, shooting supports and a Kestrel but offers no equipment-specific observations about their effectiveness, carried weight or durability transferable to Mammoth; the winning score cannot establish their individual performance. Under Commercial incentives, the NRA publication covers an event at its own Whittington Center and notes Newton's X Ring Precision business, without disclosing sponsorship of the listed gear.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/jessie-harrison-closes-season-on-top-at-u-s-ipsc-nationals/","version_id":"ae9f43c7ca6cc6a190dd48443bc9169ed5ce1277e63553b63c9a86f3b9191d0a","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, Harrison's IPSC standings, stage scores and season narrative provide no evaluation of eligible Mammoth gear. Under Commercial incentives, Harrison is explicitly Team Taurus captain and the NRA publication directs readers to Taurus, so this is a commercially connected competitor report rather than independent gear evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/mein-doubles-up-at-2026-nsca-south-central-regional/","version_id":"98fd0634da21a7482b45e732f815b43fe13838fbfaccbcaa0f16f20c5e4c906c","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, Exclusions and Making the decision, this sporting-clays results report offers no eligible Mammoth gear evidence, and its product discussion concerns excluded ammunition. Under Commercial incentives and Credibility, Mein's praise for Federal shotshell patterns and recoil comes from a Team Federal shooter and is unsupported by comparative testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-savage-revel-tactical-puts-an-mdt-stock-on-a-rimfire-lever-gun/","version_id":"967e8fde4d58dc76ddaedc70706df23fffebd1d9767d40d2d960fe748dcf42c9","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Exclusions and Making the decision, this product announcement centers on a firearm and MDT stock and includes suppressor discussion and takedown instructions, all outside the permitted gear coverage. Under Commercial incentives, the NRA publication relays Savage product details, prices and a manufacturer manager's video rather than independent testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/kate-estes-wins-2026-iprf-ladies-world-title/","version_id":"15131a945933a7a2adb37b99af4d4e5d6822f5f68e98daa3a8cb0735c6b53aee","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, Exclusions and Making the decision, this championship report focuses on results and rifle barrels, with no substantive evaluation of eligible non-firearm Mammoth gear. Under Commercial incentives and Credibility, Estes and Vaughn are Team Proof Research competitors, so Estes's barrel praise is commercially connected testimony rather than independent confirmation.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/suppressor-cleaning-starts-at-the-workbench/","version_id":"5108a05ee38c068285b7dbb0c48b67f51b76687d60560775fdb0c51263da8344","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Exclusions, Relevance and Making the decision, this suppressor-maintenance and workbench-tool roundup falls outside permitted coverage and does not help evaluate eligible gear carried at Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives and Credibility, the product benefits come from Real Avid, Remington and retailer Silencer Central/Breakthrough descriptions, without independent testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/team-remington-s-connor-thigpen-sweeps-2026-world-skeet-championships/","version_id":"1481f07df460bec04e55c1ac472d8abdb984e6f68b291f85d029d5ecddef3081","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, Exclusions and Making the decision, these skeet results and Remington ammunition mentions provide no eligible Mammoth gear evaluation. Under Commercial incentives, the report centers on Team Remington shooters, quotes Remington's marketing director and identifies Remington sponsorship of the .410 event; those relationships do not establish independent product evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
